tmp_text "Hi all after catching up on the current discussion i can't but help make a comment. First off Who cares is peguins eat at burger king since their burgers are obviuosly made of spma which the peguins put semen on(I betterget my lawyer for the suit bound to come from BK) which of course Silas isdoing a Ph.d thesis on. Secondly if you wonder about strange matings whatabout a worm gotta wonder? As for canoes everyone should know the indians put them on top of there 4x4's and drove across the desert(except for whenthe women whined about bathroom breaks) while the penguins levitated the canoes and paddled there way at light speed across the desert. Boy some people. Also as for tupik your to young for such mature subject nature. Well after reading what i just wrote i think i better stop; cause if i continue I will be taken in for psychiatric evaluation.        Haplo on of the originators of the light speed theory!!!**Okay, i just wanted to relate this all to you board subscribersI saw Billy Maidison this weekend. In the movie Billy whilein a drunken stupor sees a giant penguin and decided to tryto catch the penguin and send him back to antartica.The penguin runs away from Billy, and i mean this was no ordinaty penguin it was 6 feet tall.I felt like i WAS the penguin, i mean don't we alldeep down feel like we are the penguin, far away from homeand being chased by druken millionaires. Just wondering, Tatsuo**  Hmm you sure it was billy in a drunken stupor? Oh well I wonder whatyou were along way from home and being chased by a 6 foot penguin? Andwhat if this penguin had spam to share with you? Could you go at lightspeed to get away or would you hit a planet scattering spam and penguin parts all over the inhabitants who may not even like spam?  Oh well i am going for another drink since my nerves can't handlethese thoughts!!!        Haplo who seriously wants to get to a drunken stupor!**Q. Why don't polar bears eat penguins??Answer at a later date... I'll wait for some intuitive guesses first  >:)Big Daddy T.**Polar bears eat penguins because there is no other source of spam in the artic.  Great protien supplement**No no no no no no!!!I said why DON'T polar bears eat penguins!!DUH! *grin*Big Daddy T.**But polar bears do eat peguins. After all who could pass up spam???  Thisamazes me that someone would actually think passing up spam was possible.  All that wholesome nutrition which will last till voyager makes it back to earth(and that will be a long time!! or until it starts losing ratings).Spam is the only food which would survive a direct nuclear attack and stillbe just as healthy. So polar bears do eat spam hence they must eat penguins!Mind boggling ain't it?               Haplo Think of no thoughts**Maybe the reason polar bears do not eat penguins is because of the distanceinvolved between the two for penguins are native to Antarctica while polarbears are native to northern territories.And for spam, take one object - be it speed of light, planets, Star Trek,etc., and certain people bury it to death.>>>>>Axlrose - ...<<<<<**Uh, it's a joke, ya know...Oh well... the correct answer is-A. Because they can't get the wrappers off...You Americans will probably have absolutely no clue why this is funny atall but quite frankly I don't care at this time of night...Bye bye,Big Daddy T.**If polar bears don't eat penguins, then it is safe toassume that the average penguin makes a tasty snack forthe yeti.Please elaboratetats**If you give a polar bear, a yeti, and an eskimo each a penguin who would unwrapit first?     Any answer accepted!!!      Haplo who wonders what kind of insanity he is starting!**Seems I've been away entirely too long! You people have gone stark ravingmad, with nothing to show for it but a bunch of BK penguins and Spam.Strange!			-Renee**   NAE!!!!!!!!!!!!!  enough said!    Haplo**Madness is cool, take it in small doses three times a week,and you will live an extra 20 years.That is if the Yetis don't get you firstenough said Tats**Well Madness as a drug is good but only if it is tempered by 2 doses of insanityInsanity is important part after all without insanity what yeti would wantto eat you? All you become is spam used to fertilize female penguin eggs. But of course with madness,insanity and yetis you will be locked up anyway. Which raises several new questions. If you are taking madness and insanity anda yeti eats you then wouyld you be better off. And who is worse a man whosees yetis which eat them? or a man who sees a panda and eats a yeti?Which brings me to panda's how do they get to be white and black? Shoe Polish maybe? spray paint? And why should we care about yetis when we have panda's? And what would happen if a panda eats a man,yeti, and aspam penguin(who eats at burger king)?   Just a few thought from the freaked out Haplo**ok...damn, there were a lot of notes i had to catch up onim like, hardly ever on anymore, i cant get near the keyboardnote the increase in tristans notesanyway...why the hell did someone put a note on here about houses?!like, im surethank you, tat, for clearing that uppenguins mating-silas, i love it...and you seemed to have it down pretty well last time i saw you and cool, your new friend...ahem!fuck, ballot, screwed me upANYWAY!where was i?  who knows...how was mauthausen, silas?  *jealous look*ill try to be on more to look at my boardlovedani[|:)oh yeah-what movie do y'all recommend to rent???and ive already seen reservpir dogs!**Why should we care about all these things when we have Haplo?**    DAMN STRAIGHT!!!!    Haplo**Who says all of us care about Haplo?>>>>>Axlrose - ...<<<<<**Everyone should care about haplo. Haven't we all at one pointin time felt like haplo. Feeble and alone in the big wide world.Anyway, I think everyone should compose a smal